# Production build. Left empty: the deployed app calls PubChem directly from the
# browser (permissive CORS), same as local dev. PubChem's public API is the only
# backing service, and the app degrades to its bundled offline set when it is
# rate-limiting.
#
# Optional: a serverless proxy exists at api/pug/[...path].ts. On a Vercel
# deployment under your own account you can route through it (different egress
# IPs, 24h edge cache) by setting:
#   VITE_PUBCHEM_PROXY=/api/pug
VITE_PUBCHEM_PROXY=
